			<Placemark id="0180F22DE221FBE4C3AC">
				<name>School of Art Courtyard aka Narnia</name>
				<description><![CDATA[<div>Little spot with lots of hip height concrete blocks. Soil on opposite side of blocks is forgiving enough for flips much of the time. <br></div>]]></description>
