				<name>Tennis Courts and Speed Rails</name>
				<description><![CDATA[<div>Tennis courts with many tall and short fences. Some climb up opportunities at the edges. The stands surrounding the courts feature a steep set of large concrete blocks and some rather unique rail structures flowing down the hill. <br></div>]]></description>
				<Camera>
					<gx:ViewerOptions>
