			<Placemark id="073ED6066F23676F7C39">
				<name>Graves Annex &amp; Pavilion Pool Roof</name>
				<description><![CDATA[<div>Easy access rooftops near Husky stadium. Climb up from the alley adjacent to the tennis courts. Wall pass from the top of the bike lockers. The main area of the roof features smooth river rocks which provide low impact landings, but less reliable footing. The lower sloped roof nearby is that of the pavilion pool. It can be accessed easily with another climb up, but does not feature much. <br></div>]]></description>
