				<name>Climate Pledge Arena North</name>
				<description><![CDATA[<div>Expansive spot with a mix of traditional and unique challenges. Nearby ramps and stairs are available for rail balancing. Terraced planter boxes create great opportunities for ascent/descent lines. Trees open up swing and threading challenges. Large concrete slopes on the arena itself are climbable and present unique QM and slide challenges. <br></div>]]></description>
