				<description><![CDATA[<div>Eastern side of the Pacific Science Center. Features winding path of white rails flanked by concrete benches and a decorative boulder.&nbsp;<br></div><div><br></div><div>Adjacent walkway towards the PACSCI entrance and amphitheater features large cascading concrete blocks, stairs, awnings, whale statues, and other jumpable features.&nbsp;<br></div>]]></description>
