			<Placemark id="0E3F3784672EB57D788D">
				<name>&quot;New&quot; Apartments Spot</name>
				<description><![CDATA[<div>This "new" spot, is a frontage of some ritzy looking apartments going up along Burke-Gilman, next to Dunn lumber.<br></div><div><br></div><div>The spot isn't very large, but has some unique multi-level concrete structures, and some rails, providing a number of options.&nbsp;<br></div><div><br></div><div>From the looks of things, the property may have much more to offer once construction wraps.&nbsp;<br></div>]]></description>
				<LookAt>
