				<Placemark id="0704F8F7E524F0EEAD67">
					<name>Kamiak South Bench</name>
					<description><![CDATA[<div>Cool little bench structure great for unusual under bars and other flow.&nbsp;<br></div><div><br></div><div>Some decent walls with alright connections to other building features. Features a somewhat large running precision over a small gap.&nbsp;<br></div><div><br></div><div>A long series of circular bike racks near a brick wall are great for rail strides, plyos, and wall/rail tacks.&nbsp;<br></div><div><br></div><div>The awning over the doorways is very climbable, and can get you onto the roof of the south-east building.&nbsp;🤫 However there are security cameras everywhere. It's not clear if these cameras are continuously monitored.</div>]]></description>
