			<Placemark id="02453769A024F0FF45BB">
				<name>Mukilteo Scrap Heap #1</name>
				<description><![CDATA[<div>There is a bunch of seemingly abandoned steel and concrete back here. Some very unusual stuff, making for some unusual movement opportunities. Probably a kick off risk, but the area always seems unoccupied.&nbsp;</div>]]></description>
