	<Folder id="037052193024FFB00D16">
		<name>Non-Spots</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<div>A "<i>non-spot</i>" is a place that has at least one feature usable for PK/FR training, but doesn't live up to the standards of a spot. A&nbsp;<i>spot</i> might be a&nbsp;<i>non-spot</i>&nbsp;because it is lacking in number of challenges, variety, and/or capacity for groups. This is not to say non-spots aren't worth training, Some non-spots feature one of a kind challenges, and others can be the perfect solo training spot for people living nearby.&nbsp;<br></div>]]></description>
		<styleUrl>#__managed_style_030E64063A41CCEEBB8C</styleUrl>
