	<Folder id="09BF23F09221FBB74459">
		<name>Needs Investigation</name>
		<description><![CDATA[<div>Haven't been here, but seems like it might be interesting. Worth checking out. <br></div>]]></description>
		<styleUrl>#__managed_style_030E64063A41CCEEBB8C</styleUrl>
		<Placemark id="03E703938C23675A5076">
			<name>WSDOT - Northwest Region building</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div>Blocky tiered concrete building. From street view, it looks like it could potentially be perfect for a descent. Rooftop looks interesting. However, probably super high risk since it is a government building. <br><br>Some stairs and walls at ground level also look promising. <br><br>Needs investigation either way. <br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>]]></description>
			<gx:mid>/g/1vtzgxmp</gx:mid>
			<gx:fid>0x549010dec698e13b:0xa6c154877e4a48ac</gx:fid>
