			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark id="0EC9E153AC2C6A6D30E9">
			<name>Central Park at Northgate</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div>Relatively new mini-park next to the Kraken Community Iceplex at Northgate station. One of several new and ongoing developments in the area.&nbsp;<br></div><div><br></div><div>The central turf area isn't as soft and tumble friendly as one might hope, but the structures surrounding it are full of concrete, rock, and steel elements to work with.&nbsp;</div>]]></description>
