			<name>Lawrence Lofts Roof</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div>Noticed while looking at satellite view of adjacent spot. Seems like an interesting rooftop patio which could make for an interesting high kick-off risk spot w/ great views and maybe 1 or 2 height fear challenges.&nbsp;<br></div>]]></description>
