		<Placemark id="0736FCBF7629910E0603">
			<name>Ballard Blocks</name>
			<description><![CDATA[<div>Okay for small groups or solo training. Security is present but didn't say anything for hours of training. Low blocks and some semi-to-fairly unstable wood structures. Lots of opportunities for strides, plyos, precisions, and other challenges. There's a parking garage descent and a large flip drop option as well. Foot traffic wasn't unmanageable during late Saturday afternoon/evening.<br></div>]]></description>
			<LookAt>
